      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am also having this issue - the FPS drop is spaced EXTREMELY regularly, about once per 1-1.5 seconds, appearing like the screen \"freezes\" for just a fraction of a second at a time. It's like the game is repeatedly hicupping. If I go into the debug menu, I can watch it happen - 60 drop to 20 and builds up over that second back to 60 until the next hiccup and drop to 20.\n\nTried multiple worlds, including very teeny tester worlds, all alone in private sessions, does not matter.\n\nQuest 2 Standalone hardware, newest VRC update (with the world preloading feature).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
